2026-10-24T05:51:15.2022075Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2022367Z 
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2022459Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2022642Z 
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2022708Z Commands:
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2023042Z   diagnostics         Export bounded private diagnostics without changing or stopping USB devices
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2023568Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2024055Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2024686Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2025341Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2026002Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2026623Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2027234Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2027834Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2028460Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2029134Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2029809Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2030645Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2031245Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2031803Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2032405Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2032951Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2033447Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2033888Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2034319Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2034717Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-24T05:51:15.2035063Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
